      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Harmful",
      "description": "The meme falsely equates the maturity required to choose one's bedtime with the maturity required to choose one's gender identity, which is a misleading and harmful comparison. It infantilizes the discussion of gender identity, implying that those who identify as trans or non-binary are somehow 'too young' or 'not mature enough' to make such choices, which is a harmful stereotype.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_38dc0250"
